WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.989
The status of a workspace decides whether Care offers it on encounters. Step 1.

1.2
00:00:05.989 --> 00:00:07.733
Open the workspace list.

1.3
00:00:07.733 --> 00:00:13.536
In the facility sidebar, select Settings, then Workspaces under Advanced.

2.1
00:00:13.536 --> 00:00:15.771
Step 2. Open the workspace.

2.2
00:00:15.771 --> 00:00:20.549
The list shows Active workspaces until you choose another status.

2.3
00:00:20.549 --> 00:00:26.194
To find a Draft workspace, select the Draft tab, then select its name.

3.1
00:00:26.194 --> 00:00:28.771
Step 3. Select the new status.

3.2
00:00:28.771 --> 00:00:34.199
In General settings, select Active in Status to publish the workspace.

3.3
00:00:34.199 --> 00:00:38.731
Draft holds it back, and Archived stops offering it.

4.1
00:00:38.731 --> 00:00:44.631
Step 4. Save the change. Select Save Changes. Care shows Workspace updated.

4.2
00:00:44.631 --> 00:00:47.117
Now that the workspace is Active,

4.3
00:00:47.117 --> 00:00:52.136
people who can see it can choose it in the workspace picker.
